<h2>Send us a message</h2>
<p id="form-confirmation" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden><strong>Thank you — your message has been received.</strong> A club volunteer will reply as soon as they can.</p>
<p>Messages go to the Coventry Judo Club volunteer inbox. We will use your details only to reply to your enquiry. Read our <a href="/privacy/">contact-form privacy notice</a>.</p>
<label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required></label>
<label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label>
<label>Message<textarea name="message" rows="6" required></textarea></label>
<input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
<input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New Coventry Judo Club website enquiry">
<p class="form-safety">Do not include safeguarding, medical or urgent concerns in this form. Please call the club contacts shown here for urgent matters; safeguarding and welfare concerns should be raised directly with a club official.</p>
<button class="btn" type="submit">Send message <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
